  "ruleText": "He-C 6343.02 Scope. This part shall apply to community based transportation service providers who receive financial reimbursement from the DCYF for services provided to children and families.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-C 6343) #9390, eff 3-1-09, EXPIRED: 3-1-17\n\nNew. #12592, INTERIM, eff 7-26-18, EXPIRED: 1-22-19\n\nNew. #12750, eff 3-26-19",
